{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A relaxed high-score chaser about piloting a ship on an alien planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Finally you can kick back and watch numbers get big without all the waiting around doing nothing.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">But does it brrr?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the surface of Planet 64 collecting crystals. Trade in your crystals for upgrades that improve your ship and generate points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>upgrades that go <strong>brrr</strong></i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">An idle game that fights back</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You'll need to get those numbers growing faster and faster to survive. Planet 64 is home to barren wastes that will siphon off your points and kill your run.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Endless* gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover new biomes beyond the wastes as you push further and find your limits. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">*<i>gameplay may end suddenly for some players</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">===================================================</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Compete for your spot on the leaderboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock Steam achievements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover all three unique biomes as you get higher and higher scores.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3575640?t=1749226362","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3575640?t=1749226362","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575640/7193b4fe6267cd5aec6392954ea5a4de9e070067/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749226362","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575640/7193b4fe6267cd5aec6392954ea5a4de9e070067/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749226362","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"de